    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89612c71abd86c9c5dd6c555",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "欸，训练员。如果涡轮也像太阳一样有劲的话，\n那涡轮是不是也能跑短距离？",
      "source_fingerprint": "38abc13b2720690068a8034ad0cf1749314bbfcb7bdf60d7ca917d8e885bf918",
